{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112359429270380545"]},"author_id":"2043061337090138112","created_at":"2026-10-20T01:45:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112359431380115849"],"id":"2112359431380115849","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"At least 19 people died and 25 were injured in a stampede at a Kolkata Durga Puja site Saturday evening. Heavy rain, crowding, a narrow route and poor lighting were cited. A High Court judge will lead the inquiry. #NepalBolcha #Kolkata #DurgaPuja https://t.co/JLRpjht28q","url":"https://x.com/NepalBolcha/status/2112359431380115849"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-20T01:31:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112356050259120459"],"id":"2112356050259120459","in_reply_to_user_id":"1135914799848542210","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112355896512942135","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Anshu71318769 @Blabla12022003 These photos show artistic takes on Mahishasura, the buffalo demon from the Durga myth, at Kolkata theme pandals like Dumdum Park Tarun Dal. Horned asura forms are common in such creative idols. The caption claims they depict Baal (an ancient deity linked to sacrifice in some","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2112356050259120459"},{"author_id":"1309110609074626565","created_at":"2026-10-20T01:15:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112351868206858271"],"id":"2112351868206858271","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":36,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"নবমীতে বৃষ্টি নাকি রোদ, কেমন থাকবে কলকাতা ও রাজ্যের সব জেলার আবহাওয়া?\n\nhttps://t.co/7MsY9VRuFz","url":"https://x.com/AajTakBangla/status/2112351868206858271"},{"author_id":"1920891276138082308","created_at":"2026-10-20T01:13:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112351391536865684"],"id":"2112351391536865684","in_reply_to_user_id":"1340509422582333442","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@SuvenduWB @AmitShah in Bengal, govt officers police sabotaging, ex. Bagbazar durga puja yesterday they were accepting vip pass although CM banned all vip pass culture after chor bagan.police just passing time no serious crowd management. People on ground huge complaint🙏","url":"https://x.com/Rajekbharatiya/status/2112351391536865684"},{"author_id":"36327407","created_at":"2026-10-20T01:07:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112349903221641462"],"id":"2112349903221641462","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1206,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Traumatic asphyxia, punctured lungs among causes of death in Kolkata stampede that killed 19\n\n@joydeepthakur ✍️\n\nhttps://t.co/Ww9nReSpwf","url":"https://x.com/htTweets/status/2112349903221641462"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112346189727440896"]},"author_id":"1936479909385318401","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:52:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112346198187393053"],"id":"2112346198187393053","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"4 AM to 6 AM - Durga Puja pandal hopping hits different. 🥹❤️\n\nNo crowd chaos, just beautiful pandals, divine vibes and Maa Durga's blessings. 🪔🌺\n\nAsli Durga Puja wali feeling toh isi waqt aati hai...🙏🏻\nJai Mata Di... 🙏 https://t.co/9lYpJwyx6S","url":"https://x.com/Vaishnavi_1101_/status/2112346198187393053"},{"author_id":"3279554287","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:42:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112343753990316230"],"id":"2112343753990316230","in_reply_to_user_id":"313199215","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_twe